=== delaymod_node.mjs -- Anvil P3 FX wave, child B (delay + mod) node harness ===
modules: C:/Users/Moddy/anvil/src/av_fx_delay.js (vp3.0 prefix delay) + C:/Users/Moddy/anvil/src/av_fx_mod.js (vp3.0 prefix mod)
drive: createState -> bindEngine -> setParam(st, fx.<prefix>.*) -> process(st, xL, xR) -> st.oL/st.oR
protocol: 48 kHz unless noted; output convention = module-side final mix (dry*(1-mix)+wet*mix)

--- interface + laws + registration ---
  PASS  I1. delay: version p3.0 / prefix delay / exports complete  ::  version=p3.0 prefix=delay
  PASS  I2. mod: version p3.0 / prefix mod / exports complete  ::  version=p3.0 prefix=mod
  PASS  I3. footer registration: registerFx("delay", AVFXDELAY) + registerFx("mod", AVFXMOD)  ::  keys=delay,mod
  PASS  I4. law scan: no page-scope tokens, ONE top-level const, strict, pinned footer
      delay(bad=none topConsts=1 strict=true footer=true) | mod(bad=none topConsts=1 strict=true footer=true)
  PASS  I5. concat with av_dsp.js text loads (strict, single scope) and both register via a registerFx stub  ::  av_dsp=p3.0 reg=delay,mod
  note: av_dsp.js is now the INTEGRATED p3.0 (registerFx real); this check still drives the
        single-scope concat through a stub to prove the footers register identically either way.

